# Robbie behind Caddy (docs/deploy.md): a Let's Encrypt certificate for ROBBIE_DOMAIN, HTTP
# redirected to HTTPS, and every request, WebSocket upgrades included, passed to the app. Caddy
# sets X-Forwarded-For itself and ignores one a client sends, so the app trusts one proxy.
{
	email {$ACME_EMAIL}
}

{$ROBBIE_DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy app:3001
}
